OL,3,GNEWSASeal pup that got 'a little lost'
OL,4,Arescued from beach
OL,5,
OL,6,FA seal has been rescued after getting
OL,7,F"a little lost" on a Lancashire beach,
OL,8,Fconservationists said.
OL,10,FRangers from Fylde Council said they
OL,11,Fwere told about the young common seal
OL,12,Fin St Annes on Saturday morning.
OL,14,FThe tide was coming in but the pup "was
OL,15,Fnot keen to return to the sea", they
OL,16,Fsaid in a post on Facebook.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
