OL,3,GNEWSASeal pup that got 'a little lost'
OL,4,Arescued from beach
OL,5,
OL,6,F"There was already a trained British
OL,7,FDivers Marine Life Rescue member there.
OL,8,FBetween us we made sure the seal was
OL,9,Fsafe and undisturbed until another
OL,10,Ftrained rescuer arrived with some
OL,11,Fequipment," it said.
